OL,3,GNEWSASerial criminal admits killing
OL,4,Awoman in street attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial criminal has admitted killing
OL,7,Fa woman in a street attack in Glasgow.
OL,9,FJames Paita stabbed 40-year-old Sandie
OL,10,FButler, from Perthshire, in the chest
OL,11,Fduring the attack in the city's
OL,12,FTownhead area on 29 October 2024.
OL,14,FThe 42-year-old then fled the scene and
OL,15,Fleft onlookers to call for help, but
OL,16,Fthe mother-of-three never recovered.
OL,18,FPaita had been due to stand trial for
OL,19,Fmurder at the High Court in Glasgow,
OL,20,Fbut he instead pled guilty to the
OL,21,Freduced charge of culpable homicide.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
